          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तर्क — tarka — \"logic; reasoning\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "त्याच्या बोलण्यात काहीच तर्क नव्हता. tyācyā bolaṇyāt kāhīc tarka navhatā. There was no logic at all in what he said."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तर्क (tarka) लावणे, to reason something out, to guess."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तर्क (tarka) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit tarka, \"conjecture, reasoning\" (Monier-Williams). CDIAL lists the same head (CDIAL 5714)."
            }
          ]
        },
