          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "युक्तिवाद (yuktivād) is built from two tatsamas, Sanskrit yukti, \"contrivance, reasoning\", and vāda, \"speech, thesis\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
