          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मांडणे — māṇḍṇe — \"to put forward; to set out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीराने बैठकीत आपलं मत मांडलं. mīrāne baiṭhkīt āplaṁ mat māṇḍlaṁ. Meera put forward her view at the meeting."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने मुद्दा मांडला, tyāne muddā māṇḍlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मत मांडणे (māṇḍṇe), to state one's view; also to set things out in order, as on a table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मांडणे (māṇḍṇe) is a Marathi verb whose origin is not settled; its first sense is to set things out in order, and from there to set out a view."
            }
          ]
        },
